  "headings": [],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Open enrolment",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>In Deploy App, open <strong>User Management</strong>, then <strong>MDM</strong>, and press <strong>Open for 2 hours</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/a96290c1e7fd71ce.webp",
              "width": 1860,
              "height": 789
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Copy the challenge",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Press the copy mark beside <strong>Challenge</strong>. It is new for every opening, so Fleet needs it each time.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/4680e5a6a51360da.webp",
              "width": 1860,
              "height": 1025
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Give Fleet the challenge",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>In Fleet: <strong>Settings</strong>, <strong>Integrations</strong>, <strong>Certificate enrollment</strong>. Edit your Deploy App's authority, paste the challenge and <strong>Save</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/541fb7130e37899f.webp",
              "width": 1820,
              "height": 1302
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Name the phone",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Open the phone in Fleet, choose <strong>Edit user</strong>, type its callsign and <strong>Save</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/864752cd63281309.webp",
              "width": 2128,
              "height": 1150
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Send its certificate",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>On the same page open <strong>OS settings</strong>. On the <strong>rmscep</strong> row choose <strong>Resend</strong>. Naming alone sends nothing.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/f02b4ebe7e64ac97.webp",
              "width": 1820,
              "height": 634
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Send the policy again",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Once every phone has its apps, send the policy again, so that Chrome may use the certificate: <strong>Controls</strong>, <strong>OS settings</strong>, <strong>Configuration profiles</strong>, delete the policy file and add it again.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/11dfb2b661af7839.webp",
              "width": 1920,
              "height": 751
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
